<b>Commands</b>

/start — start
/ingredients — my ingredients
/cocktails — what to make
/settings — settings
/help — this help

<b>How it works</b>
1. In /ingredients mark what you have. Only spirits, liqueurs, vermouths, wine and bitters are needed: they are hard to buy on the go. Juices, citrus, syrups and ice do not need to be marked.
2. In /cocktails the bot shows what you can make, cocktails missing one or two ingredients, and what to buy to unlock more.
3. In a cocktail card ✅ means you have the ingredient, ❌ means it is missing, • means it can be bought in a shop.

The bot works in private chats only. Non-alcoholic cocktails are not available yet.
